{"text":"永平五年正月中檡，法陵爲國并父母、師僧、善友知識、法界衆生，敬造。張如來、□法護、□伯方、□□□、□□□、元法郎、元迎男、元法洛、元若仁、李□奴；□□□、□□□、李慶祖、□□□、李法道、□敬遵、元□生、李卷成、孫道□、比丘□、□□□、□□□、□□□。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"法陵","refId":null,"text":"法陵","start":9,"end":11},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"善知識","refId":null,"text":"知識","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"法界","refId":null,"text":"法界","start":25,"end":27},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":27,"end":29},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張如來","refId":null,"text":"張如來","start":33,"end":36},{"name":"PersonName","term":"元法郎","refId":null,"text":"元法郎","start":53,"end":56},{"name":"PersonName","term":"元迎男","refId":null,"text":"元迎男","start":57,"end":60},{"name":"PersonName","term":"元法洛","refId":null,"text":"元法洛","start":61,"end":64},{"name":"PersonName","term":"元若仁","refId":null,"text":"元若仁","start":65,"end":68},{"name":"PersonName","term":"李慶祖","refId":null,"text":"李慶祖","start":81,"end":84},{"name":"PersonName","term":"李法道","refId":null,"text":"李法道","start":89,"end":92},{"name":"PersonName","term":"李卷成","refId":null,"text":"李卷成","start":101,"end":104},{"name":"PersonName","term":"孫道","refId":null,"text":"孫道","start":105,"end":107}]}